cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "attack-kg-agent: Knowledge-graph validation and repair of LLM mappings to MITRE ATT&CK"
abstract: >-
  An LLM agent that maps security alerts to MITRE ATT&CK, grounded in an RDF
  knowledge graph of ATT&CK v20 whose SPARQL rules and symbolic validator check
  and repair its answers. Includes a benchmark built from SigmaHQ detection
  rules and the results of four systems: keyword retrieval, the model answering
  from memory, the same answers repaired through the graph, and the
  graph-grounded agent.
authors:
